==Strategy==
The Sir Seals in this stage will give you plenty of money, and there is more than a minute until the Teacher Bun Bun spawns, so level up your wallet and save up as much money as you can during this time. Because of the Teacher Bun Bun in this stage, it is recommended to use 3 meatshields ([[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] are recommended) so that you can stall him while taking him and the other enemies down. Use strong area attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or preferably [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] to take out Bun Bun and his accompaniments, and perhaps a Long Distance attacker (such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter]] or [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Medalist Cat]]) to take out Mighty Gui Zuli.

